Package: OlinkViz
Title: Visualization Toolkit for Olink Proteomics Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lucas", "", "", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "lucas@example.com")
    )
Description: Provides ready-made, publication-quality visualization functions
    tailored to Olink NPX proteomics data. Includes volcano plots, heatmaps,
    PCA and UMAP projections, boxplots, dot plots, correlation matrices, and
    longitudinal trajectory plots. Bundles 11 curated Olink datasets from
    published studies spanning Long COVID, primary CNS lymphoma, myasthenia
    gravis, tuberculosis, and Down syndrome. Also includes a companion Shiny
    application for interactive exploration with support for custom data upload.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/example/OlinkViz
BugReports: https://github.com/example/OlinkViz/issues
